{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/8311173/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日友達に\nまりかすきそうだからと、\n買ってくれて\nプレゼントしてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トカゲのストラップ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかくだからスクールバッグに\nつけようて思ったけど、\nみんなびっくりすると思うから\n部屋に飾る"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/8311173/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうぅう><"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/8311173/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近豆乳を毎日飲んでる私"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/8311173/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"健康的健康的"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝スムージーにして飲むんです。\nおいし♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は冷凍ブルーベリーとバナナと\nヨーグルトと豆乳で作ってます。\nミキサーにかけるだけー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ試してみてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/8311173/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/8311173/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆきな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/8311173/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒髪になってた！かわいいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/8311173/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事、間違えて「まりかさ」て\n打ったまま気づかなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/8311173/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オゥ\nまりかさって誰やぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、明日も頑張りまりか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}